.TH tutreemap n 0.1 tclutils
.SH tclutils::tutreemap
.PP
Parses a Mermaid \fBtreemap\-beta\fR block and renders it as a \fBsquarified treemap\fR \-\- area\-proportional nested rectangles \-\- natively (SVG or PNG) through the pure\-Tcl engine. A self\-contained 2D renderer in the \fBtclutils::tuflow\fR family (like \fBtupie\fR / \fBtukanban\fR / \fBtupacket\fR); normally you call \fBtuflow::toSvg\fR / \fBtuflow::toPng\fR, which dispatch here. A treemap is a hierarchical area chart, not a node\-edge graph, so it does \fBnot\fR go through \fBtudiagram\fR.
.SS Package
.CS
package require tclutils::tutreemap 0.1
.CE
.SS Commands
.CS
::tclutils::tutreemap::parse text                          ;# -> nested tree dict
::tclutils::tutreemap::toSvg  model ?-width W? ?-height H? ?-fontfile f? ?-scale n?
::tclutils::tutreemap::toPng  model ?...?                  ;# -> PNG bytes
::tclutils::tutreemap::writeSvg model file ?...?
::tclutils::tutreemap::writePng model file ?...?
.CE
.PP
\fBparse\fR returns the root node \fB{name "" value <total> children {...}}\fR; each child is the same shape. A branch's \fBvalue\fR is the sum of its children; a leaf's is the number it was given.
.SS "Supported syntax (Mermaid subset)"
.CS
treemap-beta
"Section"                -> a branch (parent); value = sum of children
    "Leaf": <value>      -> a leaf with a numeric value
        ...              -> deeper indentation = deeper nesting
.CE
.IP \(bu
The header is \fBtreemap\-beta\fR (or bare \fBtreemap\fR).
.IP \(bu
Indentation defines the hierarchy; a node with a value and no deeper\-indented lines is a leaf, otherwise a branch.
.IP \(bu
A \fB:::class\fR styling tag and \fBclassDef\fR / \fBstyle\fR lines are parsed off and \fBignored\fR (v1). Blank lines and \fB%%\fR comments are ignored.
.IP \(bu
Quotes around names are recommended (Mermaid style); a bare \fBName: value\fR / \fBName\fR is tolerated.
.SS Layout
.PP
Tiling uses the \fBsquarify\fR algorithm (Bruls/Huizing/van Wijk): children are sorted by value and packed into rows so each cell stays close to square, which makes areas easy to compare. Each branch below the root draws a header bar with its name; leaves show name + value when the cell is large enough. Colours come from a fixed palette assigned per top\-level section and lightened with depth, so the hierarchy reads at a glance; nested branches get their own darker header bar.
.SS "v1 limitations (honest)"
.IP \(bu
Styling (\fB:::class\fR, \fBclassDef\fR, theme, \fBvalueFormat\fR) is ignored.
.IP \(bu
Labels are clipped to their cell, not wrapped or shrunk; very small cells show no label.
.IP \(bu
Negative values are dropped (a treemap needs non\-negative areas).
.IP \(bu
A node given a value \fIand\fR children is treated as a branch (the children's sum wins over the explicit value).
.SS Options
.PP
\fB\-width\fR (default 640), \fB\-height\fR (default 400), \fB\-fontfile\fR (a TTF for real\-font labels via \fBGlyphs\fR; PNG only \-\- otherwise the built\-in 6x8 bitmap font with German umlauts via real codepoints), \fB\-scale\fR (positive integer; enlarges the PNG canvas, SVG ignores it).
.SS Usage
.CS
package require tclutils::tutreemap
set src {treemap-beta
    "Annual Budget"
        "Operations"
            "Salaries": 700000
            "Equipment": 200000
        "Marketing"
            "Advertising": 400000}
::tclutils::tutreemap::writePng [::tclutils::tutreemap::parse $src] budget.png -scale 3
.CE
.PP
In Markdown, \fBtreemap\-beta\fR rides on the \fB```mermaid\fR fence, so docir's raster sinks render it through \fBtuflow::toPng\fR; no docir change is needed.
.SS Notes
.IP \(bu
Companion: \fBtclutils::tusvg\fR / \fBtclutils::tupngdraw\fR (canvas), \fBtclutils::tuflow\fR (dispatch).
.IP \(bu
Cells, headers and labels use only rect/text primitives, so SVG and PNG stay congruent.
.IP \(bu
\fBtuflow::parse\fR rejects \fBtreemap\-beta\fR with \fB{TCLUTILS TUFLOW UNSUPPORTED}\fR (it is not a node\-edge graph); the facade \fBtoSvg\fR/\fBtoPng\fR is the render path, exactly as for \fBpie\fR / \fBkanban\fR / \fBpacket\fR.
.SS "Error codes"
.PP
\fB\-errorcode {TCLUTILS TUTREEMAP <REASON>}\fR \-\- \fBEMPTY\fR (no header / no nodes), \fBVALUE\fR (non\-numeric value), \fBARG\fR (bad \fB\-scale\fR), \fBFONT\fR (font file not found).
